7711f7"><syl /><neume facs="#m-6093bbb3-49cd-4384-8632-0da5241d002f" type="punctum" xml:id="m-3f29e5d0-7754-47d3-8ce4-d2caf73ce386"><nc xml:id="m-e5c1481e-9904-4bcf-9f5e-7974f545485e" pname="g" oct="3" /></neume></syllable><syllable xml:id="m-ab1e3938-8374-4caa-aa62-191603cf55bf"><syl /><neume facs="#m-e8d65694-196d-4457-9188-83930a95de2b" type="punctum" xml:id="m-bd7fa44e-1f99-48da-98cc-67914e5dbc16"><nc xml:id="m-15ea8924-445c-4876-a178-5424035bba56" pname="g" oct="3" /></neume></syllable><divLine xml:id="m-1869a301-980e-4581-8061-aba1fa54f3c0" facs="#m-50ee9ebe-c907-4743-aacd-ee6e8875505d" form="maior" /><syllable xml:id="m-ff281dad-1f97-4810-a6cb-9af681e9427e"><syl /><neume facs="#m-0edc735e-72f0-4b3f-9e24-9a9227b6a1f7" type="punctum" xml:id="m-2f903315-76c5-47c8-a0f5-c9acbc6bc811"><nc xml:id="m-b6f59dc2-4e35-43c9-96dc-81e189e1aafc" pname="g" oct="3" /></neume></syllable><clef xml:id="m-54325957-96c8-4df1-a150-7a48f479d308" facs="#m-ebf551c6-a0e5-4663-9e65-ac80c4615903" shape="F" line="3" /></layer></staff><div xml:id="m-2866e123-9e57-4bfb-afbf-fa1498496e1c"><lg xml:id="m-35e57657-a0b7-47eb-ac27-6a76ae345519"><l xml:id="m-7995b49c-b2bf-42b1-ba26-255be565aac4" facs="#m-1a77ba6f-7698-41d5-87c7-e12cf3940497" label="ambiguous">1e14</l><l xml:id="m-612bb201-f97c-42cf-b214-2d89e3afa64a" facs="#m-f1f4b00b-ff87-4061-ab07-146a3780c585" label="ambiguous">August 25.</l><l xml:id="m-d6329777-4c21-4725-8e0a-f63fdedef370" facs="#m-9f0f90f8-dc69-49b7-8409-60e76147c12f" label="ambiguous">Comm.</l><l xml:id="m-2beed32a-1065-4d25-8978-1970710d6607" facs="#m-7aacebc7-4e8a-4f20-ac35-2df55a537443" label="ambiguous">2.</l><l xml:id="m-82b0ff96-d80b-4757-9ea4-6dfa2b6db78b" facs="#m-d4d87342-105f-41a3-ace0-e4d48da3e692" label="ambiguous">Y</l><l xml:id="m-0217599c-d8f0-4070-b4af-5ec4b767270b" facs="#m-c57bf003-faf9-432c-8217-ae9173f590de" label="lyrics-like">OS qui secú-ti éstis me, * sedébi-tis super sé¬</l><l xml:id="m-721472d7-120e-41cf-a69d-b21c9e224767" facs="#m-4aeff2fe-ac46-472f-9601-ed8b7386de50" label="lyrics-like">des, judi-cántes du-óde-cim trí-bus Isra-el, dí cit Dóminus.</l><l xml:id="m-c470a44c-ae4c-4a7e-ab49-4a3fc7533571" facs="#m-decd3bf0-784a-465b-aa2a-764eb2a26e9a" label="ambiguous">Postcommunion.</l><l xml:id="m-0aa1d8ac-0581-4aa0-b68e-e9b127ad4762" facs="#m-17628d27-3741-41c1-ab98-b20d17d3ea89" label="lyrics-like">NUmptum Dómine pignus red- Bartholomaéo Apóstolo tuo, vitae</l><l xml:id="m-6e6a2672-54a2-4024-a259-f8450383527a" facs="#m-cfa0a650-67fa-40d8-bab6-bf9170363a18" label="lyrics-like">O emptiónis aetérnae : sit nobis, praeséntis auxilium páriter et futú¬</l><l xml:id="m-69bb9e83-959a-4ec5-b4ac-09e19b1a1bce" facs="#m-3261fbed-9f84-4ebd-8a2e-806be1cceeee" label="lyrics-like">quaésumus; interveniénte beátol rae. Per Dóminum nostrum.</l><l xml:id="m-36b934ce-5879-4440-b8c5-8b9b345d6fbe" facs="#m-69463f8b-6d2e-4294-a0cc-e0ab2b79de24" label="text-like">St. Louis, King of France, Confessor.</l><l xml:id="m-6612e7e5-b8f8-4d12-a02b-0d4238098faf" facs="#m-35ce5bf5-0bda-439a-96a1-f2837926f1ba" label="ambiguous">25.</l><l xml:id="m-f445e18f-c33f-476a-ad55-7099cfafb4f0" facs="#m-903f4f93-fc40-41c4-8510-d7b354b2dadd" label="ambiguous">Semi-double.</l><l xml:id="m-88213a75-d008-458c-bf2f-eb357474bd9d" facs="#m-a3e2c3a3-bab1-44d1-ba21-34fdf4e64710" label="lyrics-like">Mass. Os jústi. from the Common of a Confessor not a Bishop, p. 1200,</l><l xml:id="m-f38f6cee-5f72-4af0-861d-e04910406c77" facs="#m-cfc607a4-f5b7-4ee7-a34b-af52a2224bd1" label="text-like">except the following:</l><l xml:id="m-cce99429-98d2-49f1-ad2e-8dbd7080e3e5" facs="#m-5de34145-a5de-4b89-a368-5ef1eefec229" label="ambiguous">Collect.</l><l xml:id="m-9e782041-82dd-48db-be7e-6fa5b1d80ff9" facs="#m-cf288dc7-9275-4e8b-b96d-c93e2eea0916" label="lyrics-like">Eus, qui beátum Ludovícum ritis et intercessióne, * Regis regum</l><l xml:id="m-a5ec47b0-f3df-4791-bdaa-bb5c50c194a8" facs="#m-656db3b6-dd38-4cf4-bc3b-6293856fd90c" label="lyrics-like">I Confessórem tuum de terréno Jesu Christi"Filii tui fácias nos esse</l><l xml:id="m-34cdad12-b7d9-4b8b-b411-f23c9b9ea8cc" facs="#m-efcae217-ee23-46fa-be57-22e7a04343a0" label="lyrics-like">regno ad caeléstis regni glóriam consórtes. Qui tecum vivit et regnat</l><l xml:id="m-764e0ee9-8ef6-458f-bea9-41f753ff7db8" facs="#m-fd3411e7-89a2-4f6d-a2b5-543e219a78db" label="lyrics-like">transtulisti : ! ejus quaésumus mé-lin unitá̂te.</l><l xml:id="m-30d1e7d0-87d4-440a-86f0-d841ec38a6b0" facs="#m-d691da5d-434f-447d-974b-9468d8d9254d" label="lyrics-like">Epistte. Justum dedúxit. D. 1136.</l><l xml:id="m-7df73e0b-9883-4626-83c6-5e0d7d27fd24" facs="#m-59adbe5b-3f42-4e67-a34f-9c972ccb9bac" label="ambiguous">† Sequentia sancti Evangelil secundum Lucam. Luc. 19. b.</l><l xml:id="m-93e2eb6b-c6d0-4fb6-be86-343c3873aefb" facs="#m-15db7e3e-1c69-4ab8-bafb-ac5e3378b6f5" label="lyrics-like">N illo témpore: Dixit Jesus Et tu esto super quinque civitátes.</l><l xml:id="m-5374a7a1-86fb-4126-a192-2a03e7d0b814" facs="#m-14b9de04-7788-4d4e-8437-8986a12525d9" label="lyrics-like">L discípulis suis parábolam hanc:</l><l xml:id="m-0c5b5c7d-c456-4097-88ce-f5fc4863d403" facs="#m-6eb5a488-0a0c-4bdd-8f83-80a777a740a2" label="lyrics-like">Et alter venit, dicens: Dómine,</l><l xml:id="m-c96b0bf9-fc1a-4bf2-919b-bf673d778a08" facs="#m-b2046021-f4e0-4b5a-9f38-5d09210606ab" label="lyrics-like">Homo quidam nóbilis abiit in regió¬</l><l xml:id="m-2ff65652-21e7-44d4-a8ee-8feecb5e63c0" facs="#m-3abf62db-a077-4b84-966b-2dfe3c001895" label="lyrics-like">ecce mna tua, quam hábui repósi¬</l><l xml:id="m-2897397e-d449-481f-92f6-c0a2c56a4f91" facs="#m-b96e1243-0ed3-4520-9f9e-2b9629497068" label="lyrics-like">tam in sudário: tímui enim te,</l><l xml:id="m-72060849-2f8c-454c-bd98-c92c2496f6a1" facs="#m-a199de42-b2bc-4ab7-bf26-ee9d7aa3d100" label="lyrics-like">nem longínquam accipere sibi re¬</l><l xml:id="m-50be71c7-e237-44da-a749-549ed283760f" facs="#m-00252f3c-0c72-4d19-a778-fae4f1c28ff1" label="lyrics-like">gnum, et revérti. Vocátis autem</l><l xml:id="m-3f01d33d-121d-4e53-8568-58e7fc295e5c" facs="#m-331e602f-dc8f-4ca6-8a32-f017bac55ae7" label="lyrics-like">quia homo austérus es : tollis quod</l><l xml:id="m-e9c414e2-e672-49ac-9ab0-75f6b23c30bb" facs="#m-27e61a0c-fc70-4966-865a-ba28fee9800f" label="ambiguous">decem servis suis, dedit eis decem</l><l xml:id="m-40fca88d-007d-4814-9492-4b42ddb6962e" facs="#m-e0704318-19e5-4c97-aae2-31114aed80bf" label="lyrics-like">non posuísti, et metis quod non</l><l xml:id="m-5a416243-cfb0-446a-bb88-8319c541c950" facs="#m-c2ebde45-47f5-4690-8aa1-27c9b50a53d2" label="lyrics-like">mnas, et ait ad illos : Negotiámini</l><l xml:id="m-b4c23742-8f17-478e-b560-f392e76fbfd2" facs="#m-9762554a-742a-4ff8-b81c-aa29979ee246" label="lyrics-like">seminásti. Dicit ei : De ore tuo te</l><l xml:id="m-8676d3a0-476d-44e6-975e-55d5da74f3d7" facs="#m-e7aa3d03-26da-4578-83d0-7b60afbaa4cb" label="lyrics-like">dum vénio. Cives autem ejus óde¬</l><l xml:id="m-82a34387-0f7d-4f96-b004-50260f8d9882" facs="#m-363bfb57-8adb-4cab-a505-b615c7a88bce" label="lyrics-like">júdico, serve nequam. Sciébas quod</l><l xml:id="m-a535b8be-fbc1-4047-9ccc-76294fade324" facs="#m-ad5d65fe-161b-4351-ab36-84984363a186" label="lyrics-like">ego homo austérus sum, tollens</l><l xml:id="m-261aa7ca-0d37-40cd-b360-76eca45cad8e" facs="#m-02df48c9-a71d-4813-96b4-3d16418343a9" label="lyrics-like">rant eum : et misérunt legatiónem</l><l xml:id="m-066a721d-2c79-4b94-a77a-aa9d913a78f6" facs="#m-081ab614-2356-4433-9caa-e8fe4625bab4" label="lyrics-like">post illum, dicéntes : Nólumus hunc</l><l xml:id="m-61fdc251-9505-40f2-981c-8fde4c7aa2c7" facs="#m-94d2db39-0540-4894-af96-b04821840061" label="lyrics-like">quod non pósui, et metens quod</l><l xml:id="m-4e2f4ff3-cd0e-422f-85c9-45f19b755a27" facs="#m-788bc105-6190-44c1-a91e-c8e1e9065f19" label="lyrics-like">regnáre super nos. Et factum est,</l><l xml:id="m-1abfd798-b995-4996-a921-7c003da7e838" facs="#m-3956319f-cfc4-4eaa-a5b1-a7087eba8b7e" label="lyrics-like">non seminávi : et quare non dedi¬</l><l xml:id="m-937d98d4-dbf8-4bdd-8968-e038551a544e" facs="#m-d83ac2c9-1ecf-4cce-a953-fd8c0d4ea4e8" label="lyrics-like">sti pecúniam meam ad mensam, ut</l><l xml:id="m-5b72cae4-1896-4291-bc5e-e485e1a4b128" facs="#m-63c5d9ed-ab68-4a92-8477-7a057460664e" label="lyrics-like">ut rediret accépto regno : et jussit</l><l xml:id="m-602341e6-59cf-4645-9478-d81333727fb7" facs="#m-3b94565e-be0d-40f5-add2-166445b0bb92" label="lyrics-like">vocári servos quibus dedit pecú¬</l><l xml:id="m-afddab16-b366-4149-a8f1-c7035c9d0f2f" facs="#m-719d54e9-a285-4c7e-a9f8-c4f939632010" label="lyrics-like">ego véniens, cum usúris útique</l><l xml:id="m-248e16c6-88cf-45f5-8164-9530204f45e1" facs="#m-327205f2-ed84-43ac-9e1e-848fece1bec6" label="lyrics-like">exegissem ilam? Et astántibus</l><l xml:id="m-c427b537-fa7c-44e8-a0f2-3ccf66bf13da" facs="#m-2c18e263-989a-4c90-afd6-5b925f822775" label="ambiguous">niam, ut sciret quantum quisque</l><l xml:id="m-6328429c-72fc-496d-988c-9d24c8f2d873" facs="#m-19ac33c8-8a38-4065-ae65-6e9e5d667dd1" label="lyrics-like">dixit: Auférte ab illo mnam, et</l><l xml:id="m-1f85c5d6-55b6-435f-8cba-9c94adf5d563" facs="#m-21f2f198-6bcd-458a-8522-3082c144bbe6" label="lyrics-like">negotiátus esset. Venit autem pri¬</l><l xml:id="m-cb3250f9-b6f6-482b-854b-631b817404ca" facs="#m-0c670cfa-212c-40e9-959a-c5048f35d245" label="lyrics-like">mus, dicens: Dómine, mna tua</l><l xml:id="m-c041af92-dbde-44f6-b310-171c197781c4" facs="#m-258db4f2-cca0-49a8-a9ba-9f6882978fa6" label="ambiguous">date illi qui decem mnas habet.</l><l xml:id="m-4d1501fb-7be6-4b91-aa54-4be2e9de6792" facs="#m-15541520-31a8-4443-ae15-fd4c364613ff" label="lyrics-like">Et dixérunt ei: Dómine, habet</l><l xml:id="m-1483fb09-d645-4e1c-8269-ef0f40308a2f" facs="#m-b186d976-c26c-4b26-acef-4f5966fbf5da" label="ambiguous">decem mnas acquisivit. Et ait illi :</l><l xml:id="m-28e91215-e683-416a-9a73-139bfa0e713b" facs="#m-5dc9b7ba-23c4-49ad-b8e4-d5d4e686009a" label="lyrics-like">Euge bone serve, quia in módico</l><l xml:id="m-ecf97fad-bc06-4742-b299-ba75cc2db45a" facs="#m-61f48f20-8526-48cd-a253-7a28e46c76fb" label="ambiguous">decem mnas. Dico autem vobis,</l><l xml:id="m-cccab889-27f3-4d13-8de7-78158d414e55" facs="#m-c27b42eb-1ba9-4962-bee7-94e05f79d968" label="lyrics-like">quia omni habénti dábitur, et abun¬</l><l xml:id="m-8fd2b675-1083-44bd-b385-049b653fa619" facs="#m-061c9d29-1f53-41c6-ab61-45b567fffd79" label="lyrics-like">fuisti fidélis, eris potestátem habens</l><l xml:id="m-26811a0b-0961-4555-97fa-6f1e3a7951d4" facs="#m-3995dfc3-e2ab-4c15-af7b-d23ecad235e4" label="lyrics-like">super decem civitátes. Et alter</l><l xml:id="m-442315c9-5823-4a60-a3ae-da4dc2fa66de" facs="#m-1e6f3d6e-cd40-420a-8572-5acbe01742a9" label="ambiguous">dabit : ab eo autem qui non habet,</l><l xml:id="m-b10f3d06-a9d9-4e57-a18b-b76dbbc69d18" facs="#m-59715037-1973-48cf-a2e4-7ef705ba51aa" label="lyrics-like">venit, dicens: Dómine, mna tua</l><l xml:id="m-9c8b04a5-a0db-4062-8394-5f16830b8a4f" facs="#m-276df6b7-02cf-4c0a-9014-5024099f793d" label="lyrics-like">et quod habet auferétur ab eo.</l><l xml:id="m-e0d46a26-e43f-4cfd-8ea1-145ba8f4bc4f" facs="#m-1a89795a-4152-4057-bf86-b34fa58b65b6" label="ambiguous">fecit quinque mnas. Et huic ait:</l></lg></div></section></score></mdiv></body></music>
</mei>